==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Sword & Shield|Ferrothorn|131}} from the {{TCG|Sword & Shield}} expansion.
*'''Pummel''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Noble Victories|Timburr|62}} and {{TCG ID|Noble Victories|Gurdurr|63}}, both from the {{TCG|Noble Victories}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

